msgstr "正在准备…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6757
msgid ""
"It couldn't be installed. Check the internet connection, then try again."
msgstr "无法安装。请检查网络连接，然后重试。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6758
msgid ""
"Windows key + Alt + G keeps the last 30 seconds on screen in Videos. The first time, choose the screen to record."
msgstr "Windows 键 + Alt + G 会把屏幕上的最后 30 秒保存到“视频”。第一次使用时，请选择要录制的屏幕。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6771 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6914 linux/libexec/monet-quick:4524
msgid "Shared with Windows"
msgstr "与 Windows 共享"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6783 linux/libexec/monet-quick:3161
msgid "Windows games"
msgstr "Windows 游戏"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6784
msgid "Install each game once"
msgstr "每个游戏只装一次"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6785
msgid ""
"Windows didn't shut down fully, so its drive isn't open to Monet this time. It is again after your next trip to Windows."
msgstr "Windows 没有完全关机，所以这次 Monet 打不开它的磁盘。下次去过 Windows 再回来后就可以了。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6786
msgid ""
"Windows wants to check its drive first. It does that by itself the next time it starts."
msgstr "Windows 想先检查它的磁盘。它会在下次启动时自动完成。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6788
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Start Windows once, and Monet Bridge hands its recovery key over: Monet opens it by itself from then on. Or type the key here."
msgstr ""
"Windows 的驱动器已用 BitLocker 加密。启动一次 Windows，Monet Bridge 就会交出恢复密钥：此后 Monet 会自动打开它。也可以在这里输入密钥。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6789
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key once, and Monet opens it at every start, for games, files and Wi-Fi in both."
msgstr ""
"Windows 的磁盘已用 BitLocker 加密。输入一次它的恢复密钥，Monet 就会在每次启动时打开它，让两边共用游戏、文件和 Wi-Fi。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6790
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is open. Monet Bridge installs itself the next time Windows starts, and from then on games, files and Wi-Fi work in both."
msgstr ""
"Windows 的磁盘已打开。Monet Bridge 会在 Windows 下次启动时自行安装，此后游戏、文件和 Wi-Fi 在两边都能用。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6791
msgid "Windows' drive couldn't be opened this time."
msgstr "这次没能打开 Windows 的磁盘。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6792
msgid ""
"Steam here and Steam in Windows both play from it. When you install a game, choose Windows games, and it's ready on both."
msgstr "这里的 Steam 和 Windows 里的 Steam 都从那里运行游戏。安装游戏时选择“Windows games”，两边就都能玩。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6793
msgid ""
"Steam here can keep games in Windows' Games folder, where Windows plays them too. Steam closes for a moment to add it."
msgstr ""
"这里的 Steam 可以把游戏放在 Windows 的 Games 文件夹里，Windows 也从那里运行它们。添加时 Steam 会暂时关闭片刻。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6794
msgid ""
"Steam keeps games for both in Windows' Games folder for the person who set up this PC."
msgstr "Steam 会把两边共用的游戏放在 Windows 的 Games 文件夹里，归设置这台电脑的人所有。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6830
msgid "Recovery key, 48 digits"
msgstr "恢复密钥，48 位数字"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6836
msgid "Unlocking…"
msgstr "正在解锁…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6836
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "解锁"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6844
msgid ""
"It's in your Microsoft account, or in Windows: search for Manage BitLocker, then Back up your recovery key."
msgstr "它在你的 Microsoft 帐户里，或在 Windows 中：搜索“管理 BitLocker”，然后选“备份恢复密钥”。"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:6851
msgid "Find my key"
msgstr "找我的密钥"

